You can create an interface that includes optional properties for flexibility, such as:

```typescript
interface UserProfile {
    id: number;
    username: string;
    bio?: string; // This can be used to add any additional fields on the fly
    extras?: Record<string, any>; // Allows adding any extra attributes without a strict schema
}
```

This approach allows users to easily append new data to the profile object without ever needing to modify the interface.

